  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Probability of at least one head and at least one tail can be calculated as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mo>&#160;</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-{</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>P</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">&#160;</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">l</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>}</mo></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfenced open=\"{\" close=\"}\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>8</mn></msup></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></math><br /><br /><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mn>1</mn><msup><mn>2</mn><mn>7</mn></msup></mfrac></math><br /><br /><math><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>-</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>128</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>127</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>128</mn></mrow></mfrac></math></p>"
